Usage: launch-lsp [options]

launch-lsp is an implementation of the language server protocol.
You are handling the socket parameters/options for your IDE incorrectly.
Check your IDE for the correct LSP server invocation.

Options:
	 --socket <PORT> : set the lsp server port
	 -s : run as a server (default)
	 -c : run as a client
	 --logfile <filename> : log file
	 --loglevel <level> : log level from 0-17. log levels 8-17 are used for debugging
	 --debug-kind  <kind>: debug kind to log
	 --build-lsif <directory> : directory to parse for LSIF information or "all" for all directories
	 -h : show this help

